<title>BRAZIL: BR Distribuidora Q1 net steady - report.</title>
<headline>BR Distribuidora Q1 net steady - report.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian oil and derivitives distributor Petrobras BR Distribuidora, a unit of state oil firm Petrobras, released the following first-quarter 1997 results, according to a local news agency.</p>
<p>		 Q1 1997	     Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net	   $32.5 mln	   $32.4 mln</p>
<p>Net	    34.4 mln reais    N/A</p>
<p>Gross Revs   2.34 bln reais    N/A</p>
<p>Net Worth    1.193 bln reais   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: InvestNews said the figures were released late Friday to Brazil's stock markets.</p>
<p>Company and bolsa officials were not available and the figures could not be immediately verified independently.</p>
<p>((-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
